gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T12:16:08Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T12:18:33Z","body":"I just found out this parameter documentation is also added to the class documentation 😅 \r\n<img width=\"1336\" height=\"278\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a32d2cfa-ed0e-49b3-92cc-4177a5163149\" />\r\nShould I try to hide it somehow or should I just change the type shown here?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3847104813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3847131020","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115864#issuecomment-3847131020","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115864","id":3847131020,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lTo-M","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T12:21:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T12:21:55Z","body":"This approach is a bit unconventional, why aren't these properties documented like all other class properties through the XML class reference?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3847131020/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3847150262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115864#issuecomment-3847150262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115864","id":3847150262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lTtq2","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T12:26:22Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T12:26:22Z","body":"> This approach is a bit unconventional, why aren't these properties documented like all other class properties through the XML class reference?\r\n\r\nThese properties are generated dynamically through code:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2487a297b236e28e8ddf96fa8d6b44a164c7cb2c/scene/audio/audio_stream_player_internal.cpp#L235-L252\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2487a297b236e28e8ddf96fa8d6b44a164c7cb2c/scene/audio/audio_stream_player_internal.cpp#L44-L61\r\n\r\nI haven't tried to document them through xml, but I think pre-commit or CI will complain about documenting \"non-existent\" properties since we don't add them statically like this:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2487a297b236e28e8ddf96fa8d6b44a164c7cb2c/scene/audio/audio_stream_player.cpp#L281","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3847150262/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3847194236","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115864#issuecomment-3847194236","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115864","id":3847194236,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lT4Z8","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T12:36:34Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T12:57:28Z","body":"Right. I'm not sure this is easily solvable without adding more abstraction to do this cleanly.\r\n\r\nHaven't thought about it too much but this kind of dynamically added property should likely be registered somewhat so it can be documented, while being clearly labelled as something that's dynamic and editor-only (I suppose). Or there could be some new API in core that lets one register a docstring for a property. This may be useful for scripting languages too when they add properties dynamically.\r\n\r\nBut alternatively, we might want to review whether it was a good idea to create those properties dynamically in the first place. Instead, they could be registered as regular property, hidden dynamically when not relevant, and with documentation clarifying in what cases they are used or not. E.g. a regular `override_looping` enum property that would clarify that it's only impacting AudioStreams that support looping, and can be used to keep the import option, disable looping, or force looping on.\r\n\r\nWhile adding documentation helps, #115825 shows that this UX is super confusing. There's a bit too much magic involved for my taste personally.\r\n\r\n*Edit:* Given #115253 that bruvzg linked above, we might want to build upon that and add infrastructure to register docs for `get_property_list()`-added properties.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3847194236/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]